<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Dec Asian dollar assets up 6.0 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>Singapore Dec Asian dollar assets up 6.0 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  Dec 96     Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		506.87     504.67   478.23</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    180.51     177.87   173.26</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    278.74     277.68   258.77</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 6.0 percent year-on-year in December.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
